## What it is

A media player for local audio and video, including embedded and separate subtitle tracks.

## Get it from the official source

Use the official link above to check current compatibility, regional pricing, and installation options. GameNews does not host installers or game files. A store listing is not a guarantee that a product will run on your particular device.

## Before installing

Check your operating system and available storage, then review the publisher's current requirements. Keep a record of where you bought the product so that updates and support come from the same source.

## Editorial basis

Product information checked against the [official source](https://www.videolan.org/vlc/) on 15 October 2026. This is a researched product profile, not a hands-on review. Version numbers and prices are intentionally omitted because they vary over time and by region.

